1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:02,630
Your acting

2
00:00:02,630 --> 00:00:04,460
has improved so much.

3
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:05,800
Thank you.

4
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:08,470
It's all thanks to your advice.

5
00:00:08,470 --> 00:00:09,970
You were thinking of your mother, right?

6
00:00:09,970 --> 00:00:10,970
Huh?

7
00:00:11,680 --> 00:00:13,810
Thinking of someone you love

8
00:00:13,810 --> 00:00:15,020
is what made it so good, right?

9
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:19,940
Minato?

10
00:00:22,110 --> 00:00:23,980
Well...

11
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:25,480
What is it?

12
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:28,990
The person I love...

13
00:00:28,990 --> 00:00:29,990
Yeah?

14
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:33,620
The person I love is...

15
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:34,620
Hey!

16
00:00:35,330 --> 00:00:36,120
Huh?

17
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:37,410
Kaede?

18
00:00:38,870 --> 00:00:41,080
The last train already left,
so I had to walk.

19
00:00:41,080 --> 00:00:42,040
It's all your fault

20
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:43,920
for taking so long!

21
00:00:44,420 --> 00:00:45,550
Sorry about that.

22
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:47,960
Minato,

23
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:49,590
what were you trying to say?

24
00:00:49,590 --> 00:00:50,300
Oh.

25
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:52,180
It's nothing.

26
00:00:52,180 --> 00:00:53,600
Good work today!

27
00:01:06,610 --> 00:01:08,360
I love you.
